 "version": "1.0.0",
 "changelog": "First release of the NEW Elevation Editor (Joshua's 2026-10-17 design \u2014 replaces the parked 2.0.x line, whose source stays in editor/ untouched). A 3D viewport shows a road standing in its terrain. Click the road's two ends to mark a stretch, press Change elevation (the stretch segments itself), drag up or down to lift the TERRAIN \u2014 the road follows, forming a smooth hill \u2014 then Submit resolidifies the edit into the game data: terrain lifts appended to the zone's lifts file and every touched road re-draped, pushed to GitHub and verified by re-download, with the map version bumped so phones pick it up. Only what changed is ever written. Built on the shared suite core (3D viewport, ground math, GitHub round-trip, shared download cache) \u2014 no code copied per-app. Refinement layer still to come: Android-style selection handles with the magnifier.",
